(7707320, 1265897, 30049, '<td valign="top">I found this a very interesting street scene that captured my attention for awhile.  Feels a little bit like an old movie (60''s or 70''s) scene; maybe something featuring Bruce Lee?  :-)   The hotel sign in the upper right, for some reason, added a touch of *something* for me (reality or intrigue).  Anyway ... was a top score for me.  Nicely seen and captured!</td>', 'I found this a very interesting street scene that captured my attention for awhile.  Feels a little bit like an old movie (60''s or 70''s) scene; maybe something featuring Bruce Lee?  :-)   The hotel sign in the upper right, for some reason, added a touch of *something* for me (reality or intrigue).  Anyway ... was a top score for me.  Nicely seen and captured!', '2021-11-22 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7707321, 1265414, 30049, '<td valign="top">What?!  No comments? No Top 10 placement?!  Extended Free Studies are tough to figure out sometimes.  This was a top pick for me (gave you a 9).  I liked the dark feel and the selective focus on the glasses.  I''d wager that if you''d been able to get the glasses AND the area around his nose in focus this would have made Top 5 for the general voting population.  Anyway ... I liked it.  Well done.</td>', 'What?!  No comments? No Top 10 placement?!  Extended Free Studies are tough to figure out sometimes.  This was a top pick for me (gave you a 9).  I liked the dark feel and the selective focus on the glasses.  I''d wager that if you''d been able to get the glasses AND the area around his nose in focus this would have made Top 5 for the general voting population.  Anyway ... I liked it.  Well done.', '2021-11-22 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
