<br/>
<br/>I''d be saying don''t let a vote of 1 stop you .. if you truly love photography and like to enter the challenges .. keep doing it .. 

<br/>
<br/>also what I''ve found when a photo doesn''t get the love I feel it should during voting .. I tell myself that in a day or so I will have forgotten the ''hurt'' .. 

